      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the sentences, using RUN/LOOK/GO/PUT. You may need to change the form of the verbs.</strong></p>\n<p>1. People in our local community often <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.1</label><input id='fbo-903786-0' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='0' name='fbo-903786-0' type='text' size='3' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903786-0' /></span></strong> out to enjoy the weekend markets together.</p>\n<p>2. The local store <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.2</label><input id='fbo-903786-1' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='1' name='fbo-903786-1' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903786-1' /></span></strong> out of fresh vegetables, so I had to go to another shop.</p>\n<p>3. The firefighters quickly <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.3</label><input id='fbo-903786-2' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='2' name='fbo-903786-2' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903786-2' /></span></strong> out the fire to keep the neighborhood safe.</p>\n<p>4. I like <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.4</label><input id='fbo-903786-3' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='3' name='fbo-903786-3' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903786-3' /></span></strong> around the local park and enjoy the beautiful scenery.</p>",
