      "questionNumber": 14,
      "questionName": "police officer, firefighter, garbage collector, electrician",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation, using the following words.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/set_2_-_local_community_52c39cde.png\" alt width=\"500\"></p>\n<p>Anna: Hey, Tom! Have you ever thought about how many people work to keep our community running?</p>\n<p>Tom: Yeah, I have. I always notice the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-903776-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-903776-0' type='text' size='16' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903776-0' /></span> </strong>patrolling the area to keep everyone safe.</p>\n<p>Anna: True! And I&#8217;ve seen the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-903776-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-903776-1' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903776-1' /></span></strong> fixing streetlights when they go out. It&#8217;s such an important job.</p>\n<p>Tom: Absolutely. What about the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-903776-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-903776-2' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903776-2' /></span></strong>? They&#8217;re always so quick to respond whenever there&#8217;s a fire.</p>\n<p>Anna: Oh, and we can&#8217;t forget the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-903776-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-903776-3' type='text' size='21' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903776-3' /></span></strong>. Without them, the streets would be a mess.</p>\n<p>Tom: You&#8217;re right. All these community helpers make our neighborhood better and safer. We should appreciate them more.</p>\n<p>Anna: Totally! They all deserve a big thank-you for everything they do.</p>",
      "passageText": null,
