      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Complete the text, using the words given.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bat Trang Village in Vietnam is famous for making pottery, which is its <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-903853-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-903853-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903853-0'></option><option value=\"experiment\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-0-experiment'>experiment</option><option value=\"speciality\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-0-speciality'>speciality</option><option value=\"artisan\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-0-artisan'>artisan</option><option value=\"technology\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-0-technology'>technology</option></select></span></strong>. The art of making traditional pottery is passed <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-903853-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-903853-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903853-1'></option><option value=\"off\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-1-off'>off</option><option value=\"down\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-1-down'>down</option><option value=\"on\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-1-on'>on</option><option value=\"up\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-1-up'>up</option></select></span></strong> from generation to generation. The older members of the village are <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-903853-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-903853-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903853-2'></option><option value=\"harmful\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-2-harmful'>harmful</option><option value=\"unfit\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-2-unfit'>unfit</option><option value=\"challenging\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-2-challenging'>challenging</option><option value=\"responsible\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-2-responsible'>responsible</option></select></span></strong> for teaching younger people the skills they need to continue inheriting and promoting the technique of making pottery. The members of the village understand the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-903853-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-903853-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903853-3'></option><option value=\"distance\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-3-distance'>distance</option><option value=\"hygiene\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-3-hygiene'>hygiene</option><option value=\"safety\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-3-safety'>safety</option><option value=\"importance\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-3-importance'>importance</option></select></span></strong> of this practice because it keeps the culture and history of the village alive. It's also important to keep <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-903853-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-903853-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903853-4'></option><option value=\"accusing\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-4-accusing'>accusing</option><option value=\"warning\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-4-warning'>warning</option><option value=\"reminding\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-4-reminding'>reminding</option><option value=\"forgiving\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903853-4-forgiving'>forgiving</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;the younger generation of the value of the tradition so they do not forget it. The tradition not only gives villagers a sense of pride but also brings them closer together, as they share the same heritage and values.&nbsp;</p>",
